2026-06-05 11:58:44 [deepseek-v4] • Important notes:*
2026-06-05 11:58:44 [deepseek-v4] - The reader thread runs indefinitely; you may want a way to stop it (e.g., an atomic flag or close
2026-06-05 11:58:44 [deepseek-v4] the handle from main).
