2026-06-05 14:37:03 [deepseek-v4] The command name is whatever you define in your JSON‑RPC protocol. In our earlier discussion, we
2026-06-05 14:37:03 [deepseek-v4] used "setclock" as the method:
2026-06-05 14:37:03 [deepseek-v4] 
2026-06-05 14:37:03 [deepseek-v4] 
