2026-06-05 14:37:23 [deepseek-v4] In the RP2350 SDK, the function to set the real‑time clock (RTC) is:
2026-06-05 14:37:23 [deepseek-v4] 
2026-06-05 14:37:23 [deepseek-v4] 
2026-06-05 14:37:23 [deepseek-v4] void rtc_set_datetime(datetime_t *t);
