2026-06-19 14:14:10 [grok-build-0.1] (`plainHistory`, `strictHistory`, `multiHistory`, `inlineHistory`). This is fragile and easy to get
2026-06-19 14:14:10 [grok-build-0.1] out of sync when adding new roles or fields.
