2026-06-19 14:18:10 [grok-build-0.1] ### /star
2026-06-19 14:18:10 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-06-19 14:18:10 [grok-build-0.1] Manage stars on shared files. Stars are used to selectively include files when `starshare` config is enabled.
2026-06-19 14:18:10 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-06-19 14:18:10 [grok-build-0.1] Usage:
2026-06-19 14:18:10 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-06-19 14:18:10 [grok-build-0.1] * `/star` — List all shares with their current star status (sorted by size)
2026-06-19 14:18:10 [grok-build-0.1] * `/star <index>` — Add one star to the share at that index
2026-06-19 14:18:10 [grok-build-0.1] * `/star clear` — Remove all stars from the current project's shares
2026-06-19 14:18:10 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-06-19 14:18:10 [grok-build-0.1] Example:
2026-06-19 14:18:10 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-06-19 14:18:10 [grok-build-0.1] /star
2026-06-19 14:18:10 [grok-build-0.1] /star 3
2026-06-19 14:18:10 [grok-build-0.1] /star clear
2026-06-19 14:18:10 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-06-19 14:18:10 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-06-19 14:18:10 [grok-build-0.1] Stars are stored per share and are project-aware. Only shares with stars are committed when `starshare` is true.
2026-06-19 14:18:10 [grok-build-0.1] 
