2026-06-19 15:18:02 [deepseek-v4-flash] bootloader (UF2) mode.
2026-06-19 15:18:02 [deepseek-v4-flash] - `echocoms.exe` – Sends `<ping>\n` and starts a reader thread to display responses (for
