2026-06-19 15:18:02 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-06-19 15:18:02 [deepseek-v4-flash] 1. Missing `closeComPort` in `resetcoms.cpp` – The call is commented out; handles are
2026-06-19 15:18:02 [deepseek-v4-flash] leaked.
