2026-06-20 00:05:23 [grok-build-0.1] Here's a clean way to get the current Unix timestamp (seconds since 1970) from a batch file
2026-06-20 00:05:23 [grok-build-0.1] and pass it to `tx.exe`.
2026-06-20 00:05:23 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-06-20 00:05:23 [grok-build-0.1] Recommended approach (using PowerShell):
2026-06-20 00:05:23 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-06-20 00:05:23 [grok-build-0.1] Update your `test.bat` like this:
2026-06-20 00:05:23 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-06-20 00:05:23 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-06-20 00:05:23 [grok-build-0.1] mkdir bin
2026-06-20 00:05:23 [grok-build-0.1] pushd bin
2026-06-20 00:05:23 [grok-build-0.1] cmake -G Ninja ..
2026-06-20 00:05:23 [grok-build-0.1] ninja
2026-06-20 00:05:23 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-06-20 00:05:23 [grok-build-0.1] rem --- Get current Unix timestamp ---
2026-06-20 00:05:23 [grok-build-0.1] for /f %%a in ('powershell -Command "[int64]([datetime]::UtcNow - [datetime]'1970-01-01').TotalSeconds"') do set EPOCH=%%a
2026-06-20 00:05:23 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-06-20 00:05:23 [grok-build-0.1] echo Sending clock: %EPOCH%
2026-06-20 00:05:23 [grok-build-0.1] tx.exe "<clock>%EPOCH%"
2026-06-20 00:05:23 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-06-20 00:05:23 [grok-build-0.1] popd
2026-06-20 00:05:23 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-06-20 00:05:23 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-06-20 00:05:23 [grok-build-0.1] Alternative (slightly cleaner formatting):
2026-06-20 00:05:23 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-06-20 00:05:23 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-06-20 00:05:23 [grok-build-0.1] for /f %%a in ('powershell -Command "[int64](Get-Date -UFormat %%s)"') do set EPOCH=%%a
2026-06-20 00:05:23 [grok-build-0.1] tx.exe "<clock>%EPOCH%"
2026-06-20 00:05:23 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-06-20 00:05:23 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-06-20 00:05:23 [grok-build-0.1] 	Note*: The second version uses `%s` (lowercase) which PowerShell interprets as Unix time.
2026-06-20 00:05:24 [grok-build-0.1] The first version is a bit more explicit and reliable across locales.
2026-06-20 00:05:24 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-06-20 00:05:24 [grok-build-0.1] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
