2026-06-21 10:23:36 [grok-build-0.1] - or `#include <sys/termio.h>`
2026-06-21 10:23:36 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-06-21 10:23:36 [grok-build-0.1] If you are on MinGW / Windows and the above headers are not present, `struct termio` is often
2026-06-21 10:23:36 [grok-build-0.1] unavailable. In that case the code usually needs to be updated to use the POSIX `struct termios`
2026-06-21 10:23:36 [grok-build-0.1] (from `<termios.h>`) plus `tcgetattr` / `tcsetattr` instead of the old `ioctl` + `TCGETA` /
