2026-06-21 11:53:27 [grok-build-0.1] • Feedback on the latest `dip.c`:*
2026-06-21 11:53:27 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-06-21 11:53:27 [grok-build-0.1] What’s new / different since last share
2026-06-21 11:53:27 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-06-21 11:53:27 [grok-build-0.1] - You integrated the simple `md_screen_update` I gave you (good).
2026-06-21 11:53:27 [grok-build-0.1] - Version check was relaxed:
2026-06-21 11:53:27 [grok-build-0.1] 
