2026-06-21 11:53:27 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-06-21 11:53:27 [grok-build-0.1] - `cls()` no longer emits the clear-screen sequence (`\033[2J\033[H` is commented out).
2026-06-21 11:53:27 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-06-21 11:53:27 [grok-build-0.1] - Minor debug line left in `md_screen_update` (commented).
2026-06-21 11:53:27 [grok-build-0.1] 
