2026-06-23 09:37:41 [glm-5.2] `rpcFifo.readLine()`. Since you already include `<windows.h>`, the simplest approach is
2026-06-23 09:37:41 [glm-5.2] `GetAsyncKeyState(VK_ESCAPE)` — no extra headers needed.
2026-06-23 09:37:41 [glm-5.2] 
2026-06-23 09:37:42 [glm-5.2] Here is the modified file with a named `isEscapePressed()` function and the escape check added to
2026-06-23 09:37:42 [glm-5.2] the main loop:
2026-06-23 09:37:42 [glm-5.2] 
