2026-06-23 12:25:31 [glm-5.2] Why so many zeros?
2026-06-23 12:25:31 [glm-5.2] The `sh_entsize` field is only non-zero for sections that contain a table of fixed-size structures.
2026-06-23 12:25:31 [glm-5.2] Sections like `.text` (code), `.data`, `.rodata`, and `.bss` just contain raw bytes, so their
2026-06-23 12:25:31 [glm-5.2] `entsize` is `0`. The loader/linker just cares about the total `sh_size` for those.
2026-06-23 12:25:31 [glm-5.2] 
