2026-06-23 12:44:12 [glm-5.2] just contain uninitialized variables or scratchpad memory. The loader just says, "Reserve 508 bytes
2026-06-23 12:44:12 [glm-5.2] of RAM at this address, and zero it out." This is why your actual firmware binary flashed to the
2026-06-23 12:44:12 [glm-5.2] Pico is much smaller than the 260KB ELF file.
