2026-06-24 14:12:58 [kimi-k2.7-code] the loop, which is fine and still produces good Thumb-2 coverage.
2026-06-24 14:12:58 [kimi-k2.7-code] • If you want to force the function to exist as its own block at higher optimization levels,
2026-06-24 14:12:58 [kimi-k2.7-code] declare it with `__attribute__((noinline))` on GCC/Clang.
