2026-07-01 07:14:07 [deepseek-v4-flash] characters and ornamental patterns. The use of `blockHashGrid` to insert framing and then
2026-07-01 07:14:07 [deepseek-v4-flash] `outlineGrid` to detect edge patterns is a solid technique. The `draw` function with its replace
2026-07-01 07:14:07 [deepseek-v4-flash] patterns for runs of wall characters adds a nice aesthetic touch.
