2026-07-01 07:14:08 [deepseek-v4-flash] corners or T‑junctions) may still trigger the debug log. Consider building a lookup table keyed by
2026-07-01 07:14:08 [deepseek-v4-flash] the 9‑character string for clarity and completeness.
