2026-07-01 07:14:08 [deepseek-v4-flash] expose a parameter to switch between them without editing the script.
2026-07-01 07:14:08 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-07-01 07:14:08 [deepseek-v4-flash] The `biblispec.json` is an impressive collection of Unicode data, linguistic references, and
2026-07-01 07:14:08 [deepseek-v4-flash] technical specifications. The organisation by topics (numbers, scripts, scales, food, internet
2026-07-01 07:14:08 [deepseek-v4-flash] infrastructure) makes it a versatile reference. Some entries, like the flatbread and pancake lists,
2026-07-01 07:14:08 [deepseek-v4-flash] are particularly fun.
2026-07-01 07:14:08 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-07-01 07:14:08 [deepseek-v4-flash] If you’d like feedback on a specific part—such as optimising the maze outline detection, handling
2026-07-01 07:14:08 [deepseek-v4-flash] edge‑of‑grid cases, or integrating the traffic/grid modules—please let me know.
