2026-07-01 08:49:20 [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] 
2026-07-01 08:49:20 [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] When you add this to your `grid.ts`, remember that the terminal coordinates are 1-based and
2026-07-01 08:49:20 [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] character-grid based. Since your `gridWindow` function operates on your `gridBitmap` (which is 8x8
2026-07-01 08:49:20 [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] pixels per character block), you will need to scale the mouse coordinates:
2026-07-01 08:49:20 [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] 
2026-07-01 08:49:20 [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] 
2026-07-01 08:49:20 [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] // Inside your click handler:
2026-07-01 08:49:20 [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] const gridX = (x - 1) + cursorX;
2026-07-01 08:49:21 [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] const gridY = (y - 1) * 4 + (cursorY >> 2); // Adjust based on your viewport offset
