2026-07-01 08:49:21 [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] 
2026-07-01 08:49:21 [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] • One detail to watch:*
2026-07-01 08:49:21 [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] If you are using `console.log` while in raw mode, ensure you are using `\r\n` for newlines,
2026-07-01 08:49:21 [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] otherwise, the terminal may interpret the `\n` as a carriage return without a line feed, causing
2026-07-01 08:49:21 [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] your `gridTitle` and `blocks` to "staircase" down the screen.
