2026-07-01 08:56:56 [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] terminal.
2026-07-01 08:56:56 [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] 
2026-07-01 08:56:56 [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] If you simply define the constant, it won't do anything until you write it to `stdout`.
2026-07-01 08:56:56 [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] 
2026-07-01 08:56:56 [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] 1. The Implementation
2026-07-01 08:56:56 [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] You need to encode and write it at the start of your program:
2026-07-01 08:56:56 [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] 
