2026-07-01 12:46:14 [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] 2. The Main File (`main.ts`)
2026-07-01 12:46:14 [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] Import the class using the relative path to the file. Note that in Deno, you must include the file
2026-07-01 12:46:14 [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] extension (e.g., `.ts`).
2026-07-01 12:46:14 [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] 
